---
source: tests/cli_golden.rs
expression: help
---
Inspect / manage live + orphaned subagents (Phase 7b).

Subcommands `inspect` and `reap` read the on-disk orphan store at `~/.aura/state/orphans/` and (when the daemon is running in-process) the [`aura_fleet_registry::FleetRegistry`].

Usage: aura agents [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  inspect  List live + orphaned subagents in tabular form
  reap     Reap a specific orphan or every orphan
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --mode <MODE>
          Session mode for the interactive terminal. Overrides the daemon default (`AURA_FLEET_DEFAULT_MODE`); the kernel denies any tool call the mode does not allow

          Possible values:
          - agent: Full unrestricted operation subject to user permissions
          - plan:  Read + markdown writes + read-only subprocesses
          - ask:   Read-only
          - debug: Read + sandboxed probes only

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
